      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vance%2C_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Vance Elementary School serves the town’s youth, operating under Tuscaloosa County Schools.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
